<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>MP5 Macro for Rust

Works with Iron Sight and Holo Sight

You should enter one of these commands in F1 before using the Macro since otherwise it won't work!

FOV 75 - input.sensitivity 1
FOV 80 - input.sensitivity 0.94
FOV 85 - input.sensitivity 0.88
FOV 90 - input.sensitivity 0.82

Works on 100 Meters and more!
Mouse used: Trust GXT 105  ///   DPI: 1600
try to put the Macro on LMB1 (Used for it)
</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
